      "literature": 0.171
     },
     "said": [
      "Finally, for analyses, we used the relative size of five morphological traits scaled to their Weber length (REW Relative Eye Width, REP Relative Eye Position, RFL Relative hind leg Femur Length, RSL Relative Scape Length and RMS Relative Mandible Size).",
